# Boost on 20's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP refilled (party-level) and PP refilled (the four moves set again, as 20's boost gave them; auto_battle picks
# between them by type).
# For TRAINER_LEADER_MAYLENE (MEDITITE 28, MACHOKE 29, LUCARIO 32: Steel/Fighting, Earthquake 2x) and the gym's
# Black Belts (Fighting).
party-level 0 56
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
